From 70d4cd5dcbc6031c4bc69f7d9e46c282d70c351b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:03:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: himax-hx8279: add the BOE2 and CPT panels of gtaxl

Besides the BOE panel, the Samsung Galaxy Tab A 10.1 (2016) ships with
a second BOE glass and with a Chunghwa (CPT) one, on the same module.
The vendor driver tells them apart by the panel id the bootloader
passes, and writes a different init table to each.

Add a description for each, with the vendor table in the vendor's
order. Everything else is the same as for the BOE panel. The tables
come from the vendor driver; they were not tried on those panels.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c | 241 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 240 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c
index ee6121fccb..3b4943fe65 100644
