+ * The gtaxl tablet ships with one of three panels on this DriverIC: BOE,
+ * a second BOE glass and Chunghwa (CPT). The vendor driver picks an init
+ * table from the panel id the bootloader passes; these are its tables, in
+ * the order it writes them. Everything else is the same for the three.
+ */
